{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1198,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f4392f7bbffd9676b18edef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "面对什么对手都要平常心。\r\n我会以跑出自我为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "717128aa246510e5943f0ec41d6a1c52e1561b61f5910736b4c56064f7a8dcda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b3f47e7219258c7e047e33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然也会感到不安，\r\n但比赛是没有任何借口的。\r\n我会尽全力去奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d41d36ac39a485cc5ef6f7c5020e13d4cf85d73db24e4c80f0035ee714d8a40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d496465b1b997e8bd544d78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以我现在的实力要挑战这场比赛，\r\n虽然没有什么自信……\r\n但也只能上了，加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5379dc45f278e486ec4596c152d49a1c0f33ffad6440f3e484fc3a56705e931f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3dd76753c3b91760cea1ebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽称不上是万全的状态，\r\n但也不能因此而放弃。\r\n我会尽全力去克服困难的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32d3b2d013a2e2931c5ae38d51e86ecee2d37693b96ab7bf4aeb837a7c4a30a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e59787d1e8c0725e1b331c78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……无论会是什么结果，\r\n都要努力到最后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "893bd1d7ac6e46597f6c18de2229ddb65a05404562999004ffb5ab268599cd17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d024d09beae29590ef773ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽不是万全的状态，\r\n但我还是会尽自己的全力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31467fe2e056fb74ec8d6348ec732166ac9254bbfb4991fca8886d8cc670c156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09374250eb1b1c7dc9a35f82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我得尽可能地\r\n不要让你看到太难堪的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fa9e854e8739b12409e79c74e19e3554d21aedac32fedb8f0080df30d2ab716",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e3f7612bbf517d248a302ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f6f9cb6d386b03a59eafb944e976a93775f81d43c59dffa89b8cc34793a942f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a116a4fd413ebd8f70146270",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1847dedf2949edc2fec2f68a27f5af020238b67e321cd8178d1f99182cf5bd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6f7e2443efdd4a98444424",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31876393918d2a09cbf09ac862a0d61e25fc14e1a94804b9fdccda1669dff3d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71773177ca020059757e3cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来如此啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d87ae8a3fe05571453f54ea005fee8195796194e0303ace0b21672e31bfeb02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a85e0732c9ccb716135c77dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa590602b03384649277b084cd36d881d4f24707abf056fd0a939443d6e5c4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dd573c34d512e02a7fb96c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0559a6c783b93077a1e03be8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa57be08fe63ca2133ee1a74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉很开心呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f1d61993cc4c1830ab586db88179b0a7f01a2cee0024619955dc148ddcd356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b26c77e66c45d3b2245d155",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为你，让我拓展了自己的可能性呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c86b108725380f4e2cb49429e7e241dd4f1b829f2f6005c09a26d6402fa373c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d216a80fad57cc1cf90e27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得很开心哦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de818868304a52b14794c2eaede8bbb8e95e4156b6dca584d73ecbdf9af884a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a6ad9cc3084c832d9d7497",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就开始练习吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d47b415b691ad96878dfa58bc84dc2811cea3ee34bc31a38bba61826e892a126",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:034635afff75255997f17628",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb22bb35449f129bb8f9eed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，我们走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a7c373bad24969da6e32fe6afee7b381fad4af6cc62b0a385fe0793f2faa3b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a2819f0ad019d49c3caba8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得很开心哦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de818868304a52b14794c2eaede8bbb8e95e4156b6dca584d73ecbdf9af884a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3352d1031a3ec97a5aa9edc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很快就要开始比赛了。\r\n你也好好期待我的表现吧，\r\n我一定会炒热现场的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b104780dcb879b4fddeb06d807a680cd96d7e6443f561adf8d118517216f28e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17757347f077b376b3ccdf49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要在这场比赛中，\r\n让大家看到怎样的「奇迹」好呢……\r\n呵呵，真期待呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b174062ff1881546ac17556e96ff1f1af3eadd27e57fa7199b7abcdb849796b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e25a94fe7a1309da8d55058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得很开心哦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de818868304a52b14794c2eaede8bbb8e95e4156b6dca584d73ecbdf9af884a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b372a0b589b39b783a5746d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張ろう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71836ef6480c3f1c333af0a309383f93523e40c0a5398a1599f381112bf5b9a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51299dc840ca6c2179667b76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不是有点表现得不够好？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6e25bd77e8da63f127ea43dbadc44ba9a45294c9594bc41bce53a77a85add4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb3139a4272574097fabcc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要再让现场更热闹才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d371323bb85e141848c5821c02c63912eb7e799f44db5f43548a8bb6a77f9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e115ee52f0fdeb7a9bd15e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "距离「奇迹」好像还很遥远呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb35377e4c1c003d205d361b1f09595c5487a9c17d7b19b5c1af6bab5aedb8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b5e1ee1bdad3a5614df2c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样实在是太难堪了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9e8785de712e9f4bb4c8474859c6c216db801bc553bd595fba79044417ee58e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:741af6161f3d26fc2eec0608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇迹的舞台有让您感到尽兴吗？\r\n亲爱的客人♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "767cdc9bd8a5fee0d025936201f5749a562f19664cff611c8d49de351172b9d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59978d155c21f0acb8f8b5c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢大家为我加油──\r\n感谢各位观众！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a802751533dddf5aeb39f99063287b7235c41105c7635086e96976d5c977addd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7422dafa129150f948859953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，你看得入迷了吗？\r\n来，请把手给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "468ea0065e1d37afecf5efef45c3e488161b8217da63db89514fdddcf5f9e3f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e313b4c1e507db729a7e53e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢支持──我要向观众席致谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c6dcb6801fc03ca33c5f0339fc9c808a25a42ae241b09273e3af98425f8c06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c8a1a44552e70fbc9c70eb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为你献上最棒的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c59c302e5457da49caeeea839fb4de45600981c27386cf852609721ac3d67178",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d111b51fa71fc919881dd2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，揭幕的时候到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7db3da3180b70c5070cbc03b72d37efb73f308766cb7924f637ff80eb6cdfa42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50bf115ce273aa576f0793a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "信赖需要时间累积。\r\n不过……天空是个聪明的孩子。\r\n她会明白我的心意的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7887b3545cec17465383398a63d82ec47da1dfef13a5b89c851134fdf6367be6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4cabc4225893cb49c5a851c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天空真是的，课程一结束\r\n就立刻睡着……不过我一抱起她，\r\n她就吓得跳起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca2e5d7c8b8652b2467f891388fac4b03d86c06a472b497548fc2b657c3e2167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e986197c14738e16809a5ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～跳得不够过瘾呢。\r\n好，回宿舍继续表演余兴节目！\r\n希望今天的笑容能延续到梦里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f90a7bd5a8d8bfd548e656baf2ba2c2b7a52a36c7df4dc0ed8b04457528c75d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dba339002db4b246742b2e01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇迹的瞬间！感动的光辉！\r\n……走吧，梦想的舞台要揭幕了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8664a245f3b73b4bc6cb59ba04a521b94c34a2245f8649f2f5c42a4cf9d33d3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62418a6f12007b7f9ad464f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユニヴァース、お月見楽しめてた\r\nみたいで、よかったな。\r\n…頑張ったね、とても。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6f4315477b1952c89f2b0d001c6149549f095e4ec03e23a7da0772b6afc3f4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f80725e6bd78c0a23a0c3a73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年の『お月見交流会』も大成功、\r\nかな。みんなのいい顔がたくさん\r\n見られて、私も大満足だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "352b5b31f828bae81e3766363129fe9268c9d9d6a664ce5056a85998cb618e1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c27e2a8fe5559c8650121b8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就去让大家为我着迷吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9ccb31b7cea47d711352f7cb3eef3085a21ee0e7822534a2d10c8004fe3e255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af0335a577fd43c35d368c90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过来吧，来这座比梦境甜美的……奇迹舞池吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cca1dec5467c23860d5b3ae51240ef52a7d92eb3a77160411a438d9a11ea0f39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac032731a5cc5a36602cd71d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "月見団子、色々アレンジしたいな。\r\n定番の兎に、犬や猫もかわいいし…\r\nうん、ヒシアマに相談してみよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f7a18d194e97e154601802519c77657861f43883cf035bd8ba9caa2446e8b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "400083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd4dc6cea95c55a21bd2bda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要让现场的大家能够尽兴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb01cfeeca7a2fbc0d16224635f25415c50f9afcaf5d79823adead9196b30efe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ab33576e21cf708a944aa1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "并不是只有赛场上\r\n才能看见「奇迹」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1853c48185899904b4de83aa57c8b02dbfc117fa095d1a9d4c8bcb6a3491ded9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ea331ff434e90f045fa3407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起向前迈进，\r\n一起在比赛中创造奇迹吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "349564ac25c768bc6c552b2735866050928149b9c7b364c2787b6b7f93129492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a9bf62340fefc517b973e0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们是因为你掉落的\r\n训练员徽章才相遇的。\r\n呵呵，真令人怀念呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe73bc9a3a85885a3e58c607bf0be0fb27a2557029cb38313be304d31dbc9f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c358881b1191b425b7171c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清爽的颜色我很喜欢哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce890745b97a16b84bd205c709f1cee212344305245a02dce4aa61c872ebabc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b35235659be0c28319618c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的我，感觉怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "79f98f6fc7c9b0fb65425b7fb7dfcdc0133694b135b0068077b77a6f5b272ed4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed4a82a1ed0924d3927c3573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你觉得如何？我的舞台装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ccde435e5f044f3bd4c91b999e6c6729e3d46963fbf006b9ba13735d9bb0b47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c504b19c07fa0ae166c546ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然穿裤子比较自在，\r\n但这样也不错。",
